docs {
  # Telegram Webhook

  Receives Telegram Update payloads forwarded by the Telegram Bot API.
  **This endpoint is public** — Telegram sends no Authorization header.

  Register your webhook:
  ```
  curl "https://api.telegram.org/bot{TOKEN}/setWebhook?url=https://your-domain/api/telegram/webhook"
  ```

  Supported bot commands (sent as message text):
  | Command | Effect |
  |---------|--------|
  | `/meal on` | Mark all 3 meals for today |
  | `/meal off` | Mark no meals for today |
  | `/meal breakfast` | Toggle breakfast only |
  | `/meal lunch` | Toggle lunch only |
  | `/meal dinner` | Toggle dinner only |
  | `/meal guest 2` | Add 2 guest meals |

  ## Responses
  This endpoint **always returns HTTP 200** to prevent Telegram retry storms.
  Error messages are sent back to the chat via the bot reply port.
}
